    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The proportional correlation je … desto / umso",
     "texto": [
      "To link two magnitudes that vary in interdependent ways, the correlative connecting pair **je … desto** (or **je … umso**) is used. Each member necessarily introduces a comparative adjective: the clause with **je** works as a subordinate clause with the finite verb at the end (**Je gründlicher die Vorbereitung ist, …**), while the clause with **desto / umso** works as a main clause with the verb in second metric position (**… desto schneller erzielt man Resultate**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
